    title: { ko: '원자력안전법 시행규칙 [시행 2026.9.8, 총리령 제2154호] — 제66조(사용 등의 신고대상 방사선발생장치: X선 형광·회절분석용, 가속이온주입용 등, 자체 차폐·170kV 이하·표면 10μSv/h 이하)', en: 'Enforcement Rule of the Nuclear Safety Act [in force 2026-09-08, Prime Minister’s Ordinance No. 2154] — Art. 66 (radiation generators that only need notification: X-ray fluorescence and diffraction, ion implantation, etc.; self-shielded, ≤ 170 kV, ≤ 10 μSv/h at the surface)' },
